{
 "_report": "Umbra, rebuilt on the V3 world kit. Arrive out of the Shadow Tunnel (kept, gate home) into Lantern Crossroads. West along one row is the town: Gravewell (kept core; Recovery Bay and shop swapped to kit rooms on ids 125/126), then Lane Homes, then Quiet Court. North of the crossroads Lantern Steps climbs to Shadow Junction (hub): the Umbra Spaceport (second way home) to the west, Abyss Rim to the north (a rope descent at the chasm edge, tile 7,7, drops into the kept Sinkhole B1-B4 with Kade's Lab) with the Lantern Pit battle arena beyond it, and Abyss Fork to the east. Abyss Fork: Gloomshade Grove (hidden, chest) east, Shade Hollows and the Wailing Cave (entrance + 3 floors, chest) north, Sinkhole Overlook south down to the Farmstead Edge, whose road runs east past the disguised Helix Hideout (lab) to the Relay Tower (trial floor 134, Keeper on 135). Below the tower a gate leads down through Gloom Commons to Mistfall Bend, a dead end with a chest.",
